Fast region:                                                      2425 1451
-----------                                                       2425 1451
                                                                  2425 1451
Above the inelastic threshold, the nuclear reaction model         2425 1451
code EMPIRE-3.2.3 Malta (SVN rev.  5170; source rev.  5168) was   2425 1451
employed. Optical model calculations were performed using the     2425 1451
dispersive soft-rotor optical potential of Li et al. (RIPL #616)  2425 1451
through the OPTMAN module of EMPIRE.                              2425 1451
                                                                  2425 1451
Fitted to (n,2n) and (n,p) data, and partial inelastic channels   2425 1451
to reproduce data from Karatzas. Also, fitted (n,3n) at higher    2425 1451
energies. Fast-region capture of 50Cr was increased to match      2425 1451
the data point from Xia et al., the only one available in fast    2425 1451
region.                                                           2425 1451
